{
  "chapter": "patterns/durability/heartbeat-long-tools",
  "tier": "micro",
  "notes": [
    "A long tool proves it is alive by heartbeating. The timeout is measured from the",
    "last heartbeat, not from the start — otherwise every long-running activity is",
    "declared dead for the crime of taking a long time.",
    "Beats are timestamps in arrival order; `startedAt` is the implicit first beat."
  ],
  "timeout": 30,
  "cases": [
    {
      "id": "steady-heartbeats-keep-the-activity-alive",
      "startedAt": 0,
      "beats": [20, 40, 60],
      "finishedAt": 70,
      "result": { "alive": true, "declaredDeadAt": null }
    },
    {
      "id": "a-gap-longer-than-the-timeout-is-a-death",
      "startedAt": 0,
      "beats": [20, 100],
      "finishedAt": 120,
      "result": { "alive": false, "declaredDeadAt": 50 }
    },
    {
      "id": "an-activity-that-never-beats-dies-at-the-timeout",
      "startedAt": 0,
      "beats": [],
      "finishedAt": 100,
      "result": { "alive": false, "declaredDeadAt": 30 }
    },
    {
      "id": "a-gap-exactly-at-the-timeout-is-still-alive",
      "startedAt": 0,
      "beats": [30, 60],
      "finishedAt": 70,
      "result": { "alive": true, "declaredDeadAt": null }
    },
    {
      "id": "one-past-the-timeout-is-a-death",
      "startedAt": 0,
      "beats": [31],
      "finishedAt": 40,
      "result": { "alive": false, "declaredDeadAt": 30 }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-silence-after-the-last-beat-also-counts",
      "startedAt": 0,
      "beats": [20],
      "finishedAt": 100,
      "result": { "alive": false, "declaredDeadAt": 50 }
    },
    {
      "id": "a-long-activity-that-keeps-beating-is-not-declared-dead",
      "startedAt": 0,
      "beats": [25, 50, 75, 100, 125],
      "finishedAt": 150,
      "result": { "alive": true, "declaredDeadAt": null }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-first-fatal-gap-wins",
      "startedAt": 0,
      "beats": [100, 200],
      "finishedAt": 210,
      "result": { "alive": false, "declaredDeadAt": 30 }
    }
  ]
}
